The text being shown through is a draft of the introduction to Riemann's published memoir 'Ein Beitrag zu den Untersuchungen über die Bewegung eines gleichartigen flüssigen Ellipsoids' (Abh. Kgl. Ges. Wiss. Göttingen 9, 1861). That memoir continues Dirichlet's posthumous paper, edited by Dedekind, on the self-gravitating homogeneous fluid ellipsoid. The draft contains no formulas, and this verso contains no derivation to reconstruct.
